BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:e-2026-09-29-jean-luc-ponty-legacy-concert-374e00d4@jazz-weekly.bitdoktor.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260928T152151Z
DTSTART:20260930T000000Z
DTEND:20260930T020000Z
SUMMARY:Jean-Luc Ponty Legacy Concert at Berklee Performance Center
LOCATION:136 Massachusetts Ave\, Boston\, MA 02115
DESCRIPTION:Pioneering French jazz-violin virtuoso and jazz-fusion trailbla
 zer (Frank Zappa and Mahavishnu Orchestra collaborator) with a 1980 Grammy
  nomination and a run of top-ten albums on Atlantic/Warner Bros. This Berk
 lee Performance Center event is a legacy tribute marking his 84th birthday
 \, performed by Berklee faculty\, alumni\, and students plus special guest
  violinist Mads Tolling\, not a Ponty solo date. Tickets: https://www.etix
 .com/ticket/p/49498736/
CATEGORIES:fusion
END:VEVENT
