 list/keyboardist Kelly Finnigan\, active since 2007. Recording artist for 
 Colemine Records\, home to fellow retro-soul acts Durand Jones & The Indic
 ations and Delvon Lamarr Organ Trio. Tickets: https://jimmysoncongress.com
 /event/monophonics/
CATEGORIES:jazz
END:VEVENT
